OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright but chilly start with
OL,6,Fan early frost in places. Soon
OL,7,Fclouding over from the southeast with
OL,8,Fthe odd spot of light rain possible.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FCloudy through the evening
OL,11,Fwith some patchy light rain possible.
OL,12,FStaying largely cloudy overnight with
OL,13,Ffurther outbreaks of light rain, but
OL,14,Fsome temporary clearer spells may
OL,15,Fdevelop in the Southwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,18,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,19,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,20,Fthe coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
